### §7.x.2 核对点 5：Curty-Azuma-Lo 2018 PDF 直读结果

**PDF**：[Curty-Azuma-Lo-2018-SimpleSecurityTwinField.pdf](../literature/pdfs/Curty-Azuma-Lo-2018-SimpleSecurityTwinField.pdf) (arXiv:1807.07667v2, 2018-12-18, 11 pages)

